belong to their own rights holders. Touhou Project characters are copyright
ZUN / Shanghai Alice. Nothing in this repository is a claim on any of them,
and nothing is used with permission or endorsement.

The three sound effects here — p-item.wav, se_extend.wav and se_cancel00.wav —
are unmodified files from Touhou Eiyashou: Imperishable Night (PC,
"Miscellaneous" sound effects), copyright ZUN / Shanghai Alice, used without
permission. Two keep their original names; p-item.wav is se_item00.wav,
byte-for-byte, renamed because the site calls the thing a P-Item.
